# Life Hub umbrella

This repository is the live umbrella code repository for the Life Hub ecosystem.

Permanent rules:

1. life-hub is the application and umbrella code repository.
2. life-hub-data is the private data store. Do not treat life-hub-data as an application repository or Cursor rules repository.
3. Teaching, Knowledge, Tasks, Life, and future hub work belong inside this umbrella unless the user explicitly directs otherwise.
4. Do not revive, recreate, or move new implementation work back into folded standalone hub repositories.
5. Folded apps may still contain AGENTS.md files or other notes written before consolidation.
6. When a folded app instruction conflicts with the current umbrella architecture, follow docs/consolidation/plan.md and the current root repository architecture.
7. docs/consolidation/plan.md is the source of truth for current migration state, deployment topology, domains, services, retired infrastructure, and other operational details.
8. Root repository instructions and packages/design-kit remain authoritative within their respective scopes.
9. Ponytail may reduce unnecessary implementation inside the umbrella. It must not split the architecture apart, revive retired repository structures, or weaken explicit product requirements.
